      "text": "Goula K (2022). Thirty-two new and noteworthy floristic records from north-eastern Greece. Biodiversity Data Journal. Checklist dataset https://doi.org/10.3897/bdj.10.e81817 accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-09-15.",
